83:         /*********************************************************************
84:          *
85:          * Attention!
86:          * ----------
87:          *
88:          * We are unpacking an embedded ZIP file with more signature modules.
89:          * They will be loaded later with the zipimporter.
90:          * The file `signature_bootstrap.py` does the unpacking and starts the
91:          * loader. See `init_phase_2`.
